# production pin locally, so the gate measures 1.19.5. Pinning it to
# production's Elixir made a treadmill: each 1.18-shaped repair was undone by
# the next local `mix format` (orchestrator ruling 2026-09-02,
# task-9a08c27d897f38e6).
